      "name" = "dnakFireGiantSway",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "the fire giants hold sway over all the other denizens: occasionally accompanied by packs of hell hounds, they restlessly roam bullying the lesser creatures and slaying any who resist; nomadic though they claim the largest cavern as their lair.",
