      "name" = "dnakNoMinerals",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "water is plentiful and food in the form of fungi is abundant, but no mineral wealth has been located here.",
    }, {
      "name" = "dnakGeysers",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "several caverns contain geysers capable of spouting scalding water and steam every bit as lethal as a red dragon's breath, and a number of narrow cracks and niches in the rock can issue such deadly blasts.",
