      "comment" = "groups of magmen climb the sheer walls of the fissures from the furnaces below to joyously leap back down, plummeting thousands of feet into the molten rock; they spend several days per climb, eagerly ignite creatures and objects to gratify their sense of fun, and would enjoy persuading others into the diving game - so far they have found no takers.",
